Ok, I will start from the beginning.  How about this idea?

New item: prayer beads
prayer beads are a tool.  When applied, it tells you if it is safe to
pray.  If you apply blessed prayer beads and it is not safe to pray,
you will also get a message that gives you a clue about why it is not
safe to pray.  Cursed prayer beads instead tell you that it is safe to
pray when it isn't, and vice versa.  Applying prayer beads will break
atheist conduct.

Also, having at least 1 blessed prayer beads in your inventory
(slightly) increases the rate at which your prayer timeout decreases.
A cursed prayer beads in your inventory (slightly) decreases the rate
at which your prayer timeout decreases.

In addition, maybe priests should have a chance to start with prayer
beads.



